  "id": "insight-therapy",
  "term": "insight therapy",
  "definition": "In this packet, insight therapy refers to Metacognitive Reflection and Insight Therapy, a psychotherapy used for schizophrenia spectrum disorders that focuses on meaning-making, self-understanding, and self-directed recovery. It aims to help people develop more integrated and complex understandings of themselves, other people, and their community.",
